Hooks in read.c. The payload's prelude is read before any makefile. The at line above a
define applies a builtin's star twin to the define that follows. The goal make picks from
the first rule is remembered, so a __main__ target can still take its place. The rule
behind an imported target stays here, since it evaluates text through this file's reader.

